# Created by https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore/api/rust
# Edit at https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore?templates=rust

### Rust ###
# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/

# Cargo.lock is tracked for binaries/executables (this repo ships the
# `quick-modals` binary), so it is intentionally NOT ignored here. Only
# ignore it for pure libraries.
# See https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/guide/cargo-toml-vs-cargo-lock.html

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk
*.orig
*.rej

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Cargo registry / local config (can contain absolute paths)
.cargo/

# Coverage and profiling
lcov.info
*.profraw
*.profdata
tarpaulin-report.html
cobertura.xml
coverage/

# Benchmark / criterion output
criterion/

# End of https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore/api/rust

### Editors & IDEs ###
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
.vs/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.vim
*.code-workspace

### OS ###
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

### Env, secrets & logs ###
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak

### Misc ###
# cargo-dist build output (generated release artifacts)
dist/
artifacts/
dist-manifest.json

# NOTE: dist-workspace.toml is cargo-dist config and MUST be committed,
# so it is intentionally NOT ignored.